flowchart LR
 A[Retail sources<br/>CSV / Website / ERP / API] --> B[Extract<br/>Scheduled batch or CDC]
 B --> C[Raw staging<br/>Preserve source values + batch ID]
 C --> D[Transform<br/>Normalize, type-cast, deduplicate]
 D --> E{Quality checks pass?}
 E -- Yes --> F[Load PostgreSQL<br/>Week 1 retail schema]
 E -- No --> G[Reject log / quarantine<br/>Reason + raw record]
 F --> H[Reconcile counts and totals]
 G --> H
 H --> I[Batch audit and monitoring]
